    "whole_relationship": "Three deliberately edited photographic scales at the right—hand-supported small pot, a close transmitted leaf, and a mature tree with its pot—make the practical choice of scale/light visible. A broad, unboxed reading column at the left remains continuous from Title to body and visiting information.",
    "positive_direction": "Luminous, cool full-colour editorial photography with clear cyan daylight, olive natural leaves, a believable warm hand and neutral mineral pots. Use physically credible transmitted leaf veins, surface texture and attached shadows. Crisp close-crop editing, wide photographic tonal range and open bold sans Title create alert freshness; body stays precise regular printing, without simulated camera text. A hand genuinely supports a small nursery pot from below; the larger tree has a different scale and established woody stem; a tight leaf crop shows light through living tissue. Join these three selected distances as an intentional editorial comparison, with clean straight crop boundaries rather than a decorative botanical frame.",
    "native_positive_brief": "Create one finished opaque flat landscape 16:9 poster. Use the supplied newly authored planning guide for actual copy anatomy, readable areas and substantive image contacts; implement the following completed style rather than reproducing its temporary shapes. Luminous, cool full-colour editorial photography with clear cyan daylight, olive natural leaves, a believable warm hand and neutral mineral pots. Use physically credible transmitted leaf veins, surface texture and attached shadows. Crisp close-crop editing, wide photographic tonal range and open bold sans Title create alert freshness; body stays precise regular printing, without simulated camera text. A hand genuinely supports a small nursery pot from below; the larger tree has a different scale and established woody stem; a tight leaf crop shows light through living tissue. Join these three selected distances as an intentional editorial comparison, with clean straight crop boundaries rather than a decorative botanical frame. Three deliberately edited photographic scales at the right—hand-supported small pot, a close transmitted leaf, and a mature tree with its pot—make the practical choice of scale/light visible. A broad, unboxed reading column at the left remains continuous from Title to body and visiting information. The intended feeling is Fresh, attentive and inviting; a person can imagine choosing the right scale for home. Make the supplied main Title immediately recognisable through its broad size, weight/contrast and breathing space. Keep the market line as a subordinate eyebrow, the English name as a smaller companion, and the short explanatory sentence as a clear Subtitle. Keep the entire explanatory paragraph as mature regular body text with stable starts, natural Korean word spaces and meaning-led soft lines. Link its ending to the date/hour/place group, then nearby access/care information, invitation and URL along the same optical axis. Keep footer bodies clearly readable, with clean digits and original en-dashes drawn as distinct long midline bars. Choose harmonious Korean, Latin and numeral anatomy; image texture does not damage small text. All typography is part of the native finished image; do not add a later SVG/font overlay. Respect the supplied roles and all original punctuation without adding labels, numbers, logos, QR, watermarks or other print. This is a complete poster, with content-bearing imagery and precise letter finish. Print only the following twelve entries, each exactly once:\n\n집 안의 작은 숲\nLEAVES & LIVING\n초록을 고르고, 일상을 가꿉니다.\n작은 화분부터 오래 키운 나무까지 만납니다. 재배자의 이야기를 듣고, 우리 집의 빛과 생활에 맞는 식물을 골라보세요.\n성수 주말 식물 마켓\n2027.06.12–06.13\n토·일 11:00–19:00\n성수 온실마당\n입장 무료 · 분갈이 시연\n식물 구매 시 관리 안내 제공\n편하게 들러 천천히 둘러보세요.\nleaves.example/market",
